Port the device scan to the libiio 1.x API.

libiio 1.0 removed the iio_scan_context / iio_context_info /
iio_create_scan_context / iio_create_network_context /
iio_create_context_from_uri API (replaced by iio_scan with
iio_scan_get_results_count / _get_uri / _get_description,
iio_create_context(NULL, uri) and the iio_err() error-pointer
helper). Without this the 0.2.4 tree cannot compile against the
libiio 1.0 in Factory. The discovery flow is unchanged; the
macOS-only -19 special case is gone (a failed scan already skips
the hostname fallback the same way).

